          },
          "sfx": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Now visitors can choose a drawing of their favorite.",
          "speaker": "character",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "action": "nod",
          "callout": null,
          "sfx": []
        },
        {
          "text": "And the real clouds can keep going wherever they like.",
